--------------------------
- generate pymol diagram -
--------------------------

* download *annotated.sses.json and channel files:
./generate_family_dcs_diagrams.py --new --family <number> --debug

* transform annotated and channel files to gnuplot input:
./transform_channels_to_gnuplot.py --dir generated-3.90.660.60-2024-03-08T10_11_08/annotation/  --all --name 3.90.660.60 --near --file_list  lists/list_all_3.90.550.60 --whole_list ch_all_3.90.660.60

* do ch file like:
$ cat ch_all_3.40.50.2 
lists/list_all_<family_number>_near2.txt None 0,0.5,0

* do gnuplot 3D image:
./display_pymol_set_of_channels.py --directory ./ --file_list ch_all_3.40.50.2_near2  --protein_domain 3ouzA01
env QT_QPA_PLATFORM=xcb ./display_set_of_channels.py  --directory ./ --file_list ch_all_1.10.630.10.chan3o
env QT_QPA_PLATFORM=xcb  ./display_set_of_channels.py --directory ./ --file_list ch_1.10.630.10_s
GDK_BACKEND=x11 QT_QPA_PLATFORM=xcb ./display_set_of_channels.py  --directory cif --file_list ch_P08684

* do pymol gnuplot 3D image:
./display_pymol_set_of_channels.py --directory ./ --file_list ch_1.10.630.10_ch2b --protein_domain 2nnjA00

* sort channels to clusters (each channe go through the same gap between sses)
./sort_channels_based_on_sses_positions.py --dir gnuplot-3.40.50.20-2024-0 --name 3.40.50.1820 --annotation_dir generated-3.40.50.1820-2024-02-26T20_53_47/annotation/
- generate per cluster lists files (lists/<family>_cl<number>)

* channel_sses_list
- list of number of channels and sses and domains per family

