- howto generate channel of the same types -
--------------------------------------------

1. if we have source channel, generated-<family_name>/annotate and gnuplot files
1a.

./sort_channels_based_on_sses_positions.py --start_channel gnuplot-5uap00B.txt_23.13 --annotation_dir ./generated-1.10.630.10-2024-04-08T08_15_20/annotation/ --simple --dir ./gnuplots --name wat1


1b. Howto find channels of the given type (defined in channeldbs), which are not in the given channel-type list (generated from ^).
They can be used as a start for 1a. (just edit the name now - Water channel

./cytochrom_tunnels_with_given_label_not_on_list.sh



2. if we wnt to split all channels from scratch to several groups